---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Employee Health Insurance in Cambodia"
  description="Offering health insurance to your employees is one of the most effective ways to build loyalty, reduce turnover, and position your company as an employer of choice."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-grid">
        <div class="page-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/">Health Insurance</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Employee &amp; Staff Insurance</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Health Insurance</p>
          <h1>Employee Health Insurance in Cambodia</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">In a competitive job market, salary alone is no longer enough to attract and retain talent. Offering health insurance to your employees is one of the most effective ways to build loyalty, reduce turnover, and position your company as an employer of choice — at a cost that can be structured to match your payroll.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
            <a href="#why-it-matters" class="btn btn-outline-light">Why It Matters</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero-visual">
          <img src="/assets/employee-benefit.webp" alt="Two colleagues chatting in an office corridor" width="600" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why it matters -->
  <section class="section" id="why-it-matters">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why it matters for your business</p>
      <h2>A well-designed plan delivers measurable returns</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Employees with health coverage seek treatment earlier, reducing absenteeism and productivity loss — and that's just the start.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid cov-grid-4">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12h4l2-5 4 10 2-5h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Productivity</span>
          <h3>Earlier Treatment</h3>
          <p>Covered employees seek treatment earlier, reducing absenteeism and productivity loss.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><path d="M3 20c1-3.6 3.6-5.6 6-5.6s5 2 6 5.6M17 8v6M14 11h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Recruitment</span>
          <h3>Attracts Talent</h3>
          <p>Qualified candidates weigh total compensation, not just salary, when choosing an employer.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 17c2 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M3 12c2 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Retention</span>
          <h3>Higher Retention</h3>
          <p>Investing in employee wellbeing drives engagement and long-term retention.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2 3 6v6c0 5 3.8 8.7 9 10 5.2-1.3 9-5 9-10V6l-9-4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 8v4M12 15h0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Cost Control</span>
          <h3>Lower Hidden Costs</h3>
          <p>Avoid absorbing indirect costs when uninsured staff face unexpected medical bills.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Coverage adapted to every level -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Built around your team</p>
        <h2>Coverage adapted to every level of your team</h2>
        <p>We build plans around your organisation. We offer affordable group plans covering outpatient consultations, hospitalisation, and prescription drugs at quality clinics and hospitals across Cambodia.</p>
        <p>For expatriate management, we provide international plans with regional or worldwide coverage, suited to higher compensation levels and cross-border mobility. For mixed teams, we design tiered structures that align benefit levels with salary bands, ensuring relevant coverage at every level without unnecessary cost.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>Optional add-on modules</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Outpatient care</li>
          <li>Dental</li>
          <li>Vision</li>
          <li>Maternity</li>
          <li>Health check-up</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13M9 21v-6h6v6M4 21h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Local Team</span>
          <h3>Local Staff</h3>
          <p>Affordable group plans covering outpatient consultations, hospitalisation, and prescription drugs at quality clinics and hospitals across Cambodia.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.5 3.5 6 3.5 9s-1 6.5-3.5 9c-2.5-2.5-3.5-6-3.5-9s1-6.5 3.5-9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Cross-Border</span>
          <h3>Expatriate Management</h3>
          <p>International plans with regional or worldwide coverage, suited to higher compensation levels and cross-border mobility.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Tiered Plans</span>
          <h3>Mixed Teams</h3>
          <p>Tiered structures that align benefit levels with salary bands, ensuring relevant coverage at every level without unnecessary cost.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Independent broker -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why choose AG Cambodia</p>
      <h2>An independent broker working for you</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">As a licensed broker, we compare solutions across the market to find the right balance of coverage, hospital network, claims service, and price for your company. We handle the insurer relationship directly and support your employees when they need to use their coverage.</p>
      <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partners band -->
  <section class="partners-band">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light eyebrow-center">We work with the best insurance companies</p>
      <div class="partners-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2c1.4 2 1.4 4.4 0 6.4C13.6 7 16 7 18 8.4c1 2 1 4.4-1 6-2 1.6-3.8.6-5-1-1.2 1.6-3 2.6-5 1-2-1.6-2-4-1-6C8 7 10.4 7 12 8.4 10.6 6.4 10.6 4 12 2Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <ul class="partners-list">
        <li>Forte Insurance</li>
        <li>Caminco Health</li>
        <li>PCA Life Insurance</li>
        <li>Infinity General Insurance</li>
        <li>Sokha Insurance</li>
        <li>Pacific Partners</li>
        <li>AGI Cambodia</li>
        <li>ASOL Insurance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free group health quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your team. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your team and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
